  "id": "USN-8758-1",
  "summary": "dracut vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that dracut did not properly shell-quote messages\nwritten by the die() function to the emergency hook directory. An\nattacker on the adjacent network controlling a rogue DHCP server could\nuse this issue to inject commands that execute as root during\nboot-failure handling. (CVE-2026-15816)",
